Exiles leave tree toward Gaṅgā Yamunā meeting --- Traverse new delightful lands --- Spot Prayāga smoke and hear clashing waters --- See split wood and reach sage ground at dusk --- Bow with Sītā and declare root-fruit vow --- Bharadvāja offers cow arghya and welcome --- Rāma shuns crowded Prayāga haunted by gazers --- Bharadvāja points to Chitrakūṭa ten krōśa off ape-bear hill --- Promises peaks bring welfare where sages won heaven --- Hosts guests with tales and speeds them to Chitrakūṭa
